        "structural_description": "Oath Breakers now grant you a stack of Mending Ward for 15 seconds, stacking 3 times.Mending WardNext instance of direct damage taken while below 35% maximum health will consume these stacks to heal you for 395 + 25% Stamina. Healing scales with your Stamina and parry rating."
